      "statement": "Song-detail rendering contract: SongEmotionSection calls emotionDisplayOf once to derive tags, tag ratios and the confidence level; the header is 「情绪」 with 「不像？标记」 or 「修改」, model tags carry a percentage while user-marked tags (null ratio) show none and empty tags render 「未定」, a user-marked song shows 「已由你纠正」 when userTagsEdited==true else 「已由你校准」, and non-HIGH levels show SPREAD=「模型把握不大，词条仅供参考」 or MIXED=「词条里有冷有热，这首歌可能不止一种情绪」. The chart plots smoothCurve(compensatedCurve) (5-point moving average, shrunken at the edges, lists shorter than 3 returned unchanged) with legend 「冷暖（参考）」/「能量」 and draws no peak marker — peakSec is persisted but no current UI renders it. A user-only row (fewer than 2 windows) is not early-returned: it lists emotionTagsOf and adds 「已由你标记（自动分析失败，词条以你的标记为准）」, while a song with no row renders 「情绪分析：尚未完成（充电时自动分析曲库）」.",
