      "statement": "WITTY (鬼畜/沙雕/戏谑/荒诞) is the only auto=false group: it is excluded from curve voting because the meme is not acoustically separable from earnest 燃/快乐 and its centered anchor (0.2, 0.3) pulls lukewarm windows wholesale, yet groupOf still resolves its words for manual marking. Because tag song counts are derived from emotionTagsOf, an unmarked WITTY word has count 0 and never enters the mood-slot chip list (availableTags comes from the observed counts), so a slot configured only with such words yields an empty pool and falls back to library-wide random.",
